# Fixed Paths vs. Parameters

If you have both a fixed path and a parameter, define the fixed one first to avoid conflicts.

```python
# This works
@app.get("/users/me")
def get_current_user():
    return {"user": "current"}

@app.get("/users/{user_id}")
def get_user(user_id: int):
    return {"user_id": user_id}
```

The fixed path `/users/me` is checked before the parameterized one.
